  - "Par boiled rice - 3 cups"
  - "Urad dal - 1 cup"
  - "Salt"
  - "Vegetables of choice (Methi leaves/ Beetroot/ Beans/ Green leafy vegetables/ Carrots/ Bottle gourd/ Ridge gourd)"
instructions:
  - "Rinse and soak rice and urad dal separately in water for 2 hours."
  - "Grind the two separately, and mix them together with salt. Keep it overnight, before making idlis."
  - "Puree the vegetable of your choice and mix it with the batter. Add this to the flour."
  - "Add dried ginger powder and mix everything together."
  - "Coat a flat vessel with oil, and pour the idli flour into this and pressure cook for 15 minutes."
